WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.969
-I think that I can say
that we are friends.

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:04.137
-Yes. Absolutely.

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:05.371
