play to prove it.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.677
It is time for the "Best Friends
Challenge." Here we go.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:13.112
♪ -Best friends challenge ♪

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:15.848
♪ Oh, yeah ♪

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.150
-Totally, see?

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.885
And you're her and I'm her.

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:22.822
And you're that dog
and I'm that dog.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:26.358
-Alright. So the game works
like "The Newlywed Game"

00:00:26.358 --> 00:00:27.893
but for friends,
so we're going to take turns

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:30.863
reading questions about each
other from the best friends box,

00:00:30.863 --> 00:00:32.765
and we'll try to write down
the same answer.

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:33.966
And we didn't plan
any of this out.

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:37.236
-Oh, my God. We haven't.
Perhaps we should have.

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.038
-I think we probably actually
should have planned it.

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:40.839
Alright, here we go.
-That's a big pen.

00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:43.142
-Here we go.
I will read the --

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:46.112
It is a big pen. I'm gonna read
the first question.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:49.515
Alright, "What would I order at
McDonald's?"

00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:51.383
Breakfast included.

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:54.687
-Oh, wow.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:57.356
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.356 --> 00:01:02.728 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:02.728 --> 00:01:08.067 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:11.070
-What would I order
at McDonald's?

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.939
Ooh!

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:14.107
Yeah, alright.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:15.641
I think I know what you think
