00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:45.138
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:47.506
Okay, so.

00:01:47.506 --> 00:01:52.277
Should we do our next -- "Taxi."
"Taxi 2."

00:01:52.277 --> 00:01:53.512
-Alright. Here we go.

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:56.449
-Alright. Okay.
So, next question.

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:57.917
